# Wave T44 (Honeyfield kit): honeyfloor — Honeyfield Town's registered street kind (the fleet's street kinds carry the -floor suffix; the desire-path tiers key on it). HONEYCOMB LANE: pale amber gravel laid as a fine hexagonal comb — comb-cell outlines in deeper amber, a soft honey glint at scattered cell hearts. A closed HEXAGONAL geometry: unlike Wildflower's petalfloor (loose petal scatter), Clover's cloverfloor (flecked earth) and Lilac's gridfloor (square bronze lattice). (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T44-HONEYFIELD-PLAN.md §5.)
